 "final_passage": "Stellate-Net meets the pre-specified robustness criterion (drop ≤ 3.0 points) at blur severities 1 and 3, with top-1 accuracy drops of 0.7 and 1.6 points from clean accuracy, but fails it at severity 5 with a drop of 4.6 points. At every blur severity, Stellate-Net's accuracy drop is smaller than Lattice-CNN's (0.7 vs 1.8 points at severity 1, 1.6 vs 5.7 at severity 3, and 4.6 vs 11.3 at severity 5). Thus, Stellate-Net's robustness to Gaussian blur is partial: it degrades gracefully at low-to-moderate blur but exceeds the 3.0-point threshold at the highest tested severity.",
